{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01816","headline":"杂曲歌辞 古别离 · 僧皎然","name":"杂曲歌辞 古别离","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"太湖三山口，吴王在时道。\n寂寞千载心，无人见春草。\n谁堪缄怨者，持此伤怀抱。\n孤舟畏狂风，一点宿烟岛。\n望所思兮若何，月荡漾兮空波。\n云离离兮北断，鴈眇眇兮南多。\n身去兮天畔，心折兮湖岸。\n春山胡爲兮塞路，使我归梦兮撩乱。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"僧皎然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01816.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01816","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}